1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,880
Every time the bill came, her card got declined.

2
00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:06,540
And still, she lived in the fanciest hotels in New York.

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:10,200
She went by Anna Delvey, a so-called German heiress.

4
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:12,700
That's someone who'll get a family fortune one day.

5
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:17,200
Tens of millions of dollars, she said, sitting in a trust fund overseas.

6
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:21,540
Her real name? Anna Sorokin. And that money wasn't real.

7
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:25,060
Tap the heart if you've met someone who talks rich and never pays.

8
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:28,940
So how did she pull it off? Same move, every time.

9
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:33,520
First, her card fails. Then she blames her bank, and someone else pays.

10
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:37,100
And she promises a wire is coming. That's a bank transfer.

11
00:00:37,720 --> 00:00:39,300
Spoiler, it never comes.

12
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:43,820
In twenty seventeen, two New York hotels said she walked out without paying.

13
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:47,000
Send this to the friend who always says, I'll pay you back.

14
00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:50,580
Then she did it to a magazine editor friend, Rachel Williams.

15
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:54,920
Here's how: on a trip to Morocco, the bill landed on Rachel's card.

16
00:00:57,520 --> 00:00:59,340
Sixty-two thousand dollars. More than a lot of people make in a year.

17
00:01:00,060 --> 00:01:03,060
Rachel kept asking, but Anna kept saying the wire was coming.

18
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:06,740
In October twenty seventeen, police finally arrested her.

19
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:10,920
In twenty nineteen, a Manhattan jury found her guilty on eight counts.

20
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:14,280
That's grand larceny, the legal name for stealing big.

21
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:18,440
Follow if you love when the fake rich get caught. Now, the sentence.

22
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:21,620
She was sentenced to four to twelve years in prison.

23
00:01:22,180 --> 00:01:23,460
She also had to pay back about two hundred thousand dollars.

24
00:01:24,680 --> 00:01:28,720
All that fake money, undone by a card that said no.

25
00:01:29,520 --> 00:01:31,340
Heiress or hustler? One word.

